18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Supply chain due diligence</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Conflict-free sourcing certification</li></ul></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-xl mt-2" href="/social-audits/rmi/">Learn More RMI<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-right" class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_25px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] border border-slate-200 group h-[280px] sm:h-[360px] md:order-2"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367934/eurocert/b9.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-110" alt="C-TPAT"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16]/60 via-transparent to-transparent"></div><div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5"><span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-eurogold-400 text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 heading-font">Supply Chain Security // 08</span></div></div><div data-reveal="reveal-left" data-reveal-delay="200" class="space-y-6 md:order-1"><div><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">C-TPAT</h3><p class="heading-font text-euro-600 text-sm font-bold upperca